#: ../../../core/userguide/pkg/cmd_publish.rst:30
msgid ""
"Publish a package to the `PlatformIO Registry <https://registry.platformio."
"org/>`__ so that it can be installed by name. All files in the package "
"directory are included if ``export`` field is not declared in a package "
"manifest (for example, see :ref:`manifest_library_json_export`). The `next "
"items <https://github.com/platformio/platformio-core/blob/develop/platformio/"
"package/pack.py>`__ are automatically excluded."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../core/userguide/pkg/cmd_publish.rst:36
msgid ""
"Please check which files will be included in the final package using the :"
"ref:`cmd_pkg_pack` command."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../core/userguide/pkg/cmd_publish.rst:39
msgid ""
"Once a package is published with a given name and version, that specific "
"name and version combination can never be used again, even if it is removed "
"with the :ref:`cmd_pkg_unpublish` command."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../core/userguide/pkg/cmd_publish.rst:43
msgid ""
"If no arguments are supplied, then PlatformIO packs the current package "
"folder."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../core/userguide/pkg/cmd_publish.rst:45
msgid ""
"To list published packages, please use the :ref:`cmd_access_list` command."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../core/userguide/pkg/cmd_publish.rst:48
msgid "Options"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../core/userguide/pkg/cmd_publish.rst:55
msgid ""
":ref:`pioaccount` username (can be organization username). The default is "
"set to a username of the authorized :ref:`pioaccount`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../core/userguide/pkg/cmd_publish.rst:61
msgid "Set a custom package type. See supported :ref:`cmd_pkg_install_types`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../core/userguide/pkg/cmd_publish.rst:66
msgid ""
"Custom release date and time in the next format (UTC): 2014-06-13 17:08:52"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../core/userguide/pkg/cmd_publish.rst:68
msgid ""
"The permission to set custom release dates and times is only available in "
"the `Enterprises <https://registry.platformio.org/pricing>`__ plan."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../core/userguide/pkg/cmd_publish.rst:73
msgid ""
"Restrict access to a package (will not be available publicly). The default "
"is to publish a package publicly."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../core/userguide/pkg/cmd_publish.rst:76
msgid ""
"Please check `PlatformIO Registry Plans <https://registry.platformio.org/"
"pricing>`__ where private packages are allowed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../core/userguide/pkg/cmd_publish.rst:81
msgid ""
"Do not notify by email when a package is processed. The default behavior is "
"to notify."
